Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:00.46,Short,,0,0,0,,Your dog
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:01.32,Short,,0,0,0,,isn't being dramatic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:02.54,Short,,0,0,0,,about thunder
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:03.86,Short,,0,0,0,,About one in three dogs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:05.40,Short,,0,0,0,,is afraid of loud noises
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:06.62,Short,,0,0,0,,and storms hit them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:07.82,Short,,0,0,0,,with more than noise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.21,0:00:09.56,Short,,0,0,0,,Some dogs start pacing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.56,0:00:10.95,Short,,0,0,0,,before you hear a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.95,0:00:11.46,Short,,0,0,0,,They may feel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.46,0:00:12.74,Short,,0,0,0,,the air pressure drop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:13.82,Short,,0,0,0,,One theory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.82,0:00:14.66,Short,,0,0,0,,storms also
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:15.42,Short,,0,0,0,,charge the air
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:16.58,Short,,0,0,0,,so static builds up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.58,0:00:17.10,Short,,0,0,0,,in their fur
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:17.74,Short,,0,0,0,,and gives them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.74,0:00:18.80,Short,,0,0,0,,tiny shocks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.16,0:00:20.04,Short,,0,0,0,,That might be why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:21.14,Short,,0,0,0,,some dogs hide
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.14,0:00:21.94,Short,,0,0,0,,in the bathtub
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.94,0:00:23.32,Short,,0,0,0,,right next to the pipes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:24.44,Short,,0,0,0,,And comforting them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:26.04,Short,,0,0,0,,won't make the fear worse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.39,0:00:27.98,Short,,0,0,0,,Vets call that a myth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:29.26,Short,,0,0,0,,So when the sky rumbles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:30.30,Short,,0,0,0,,and they squeeze in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:31.06,Short,,0,0,0,,next to you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:31.78,Short,,0,0,0,,hold them close
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:32.20,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.64,0:00:30.90,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwhose dog hides during storms
